{title: Harbour Lights}
{artist: The Demo Band}
{key: G}
{tempo: 96}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[G]Lanterns on the [C]water, [G]ropes along the [D]pier
[Em]Every boat that's [C]coming home [G]brings the [D]evening [G]near
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]Harbour lights, [G]harbour lights
[Em]guide us [D]through the night
[C]Hold the line and [G]hold it tight
[D]till the morning [G]light
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[G]Salt upon the [C]window, [G]bread upon the [D]shelf
[Em]Someone keeps a [C]candle lit [G]just to [D]see it [G]melt
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Solo over verse chords, then chorus twice}
{chorus}
